WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:06.672
Hi! Today we make plans with friends.

2
00:00:07.072 --> 00:00:11.088
Are you free? Do you feel like it?

3
00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:16.384
Here are ideas for the weekend:

4
00:00:16.784 --> 00:00:19.360
Shall we go to the cinema?

5
00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:22.552
Shall we have a coffee?

6
00:00:22.952 --> 00:00:25.384
Shall we go dancing?

7
00:00:25.784 --> 00:00:28.576
Shall we go to a concert?

8
00:00:28.976 --> 00:00:31.744
Shall we play football?

9
00:00:32.144 --> 00:00:34.792
Shall we go for a walk?

10
00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:39.460
This is how you ask a friend:

11
00:00:39.860 --> 00:00:42.940
Are you free on Saturday?

12
00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:46.900
And this is how you ask if she wants to:

13
00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:50.140
Do you feel like going to the cinema?

14
00:00:51.833 --> 00:00:56.425
You want to come? Then you say:

15
00:00:56.825 --> 00:01:00.673
Good idea! Gladly!

16
00:01:01.073 --> 00:01:05.545
You don't have time? Then you say:

17
00:01:05.945 --> 00:01:10.297
Unfortunately not. I have to work.

18
00:01:10.697 --> 00:01:15.529
Always say why. That's friendly.

19
00:01:17.233 --> 00:01:20.913
Listen: Lena has an idea.

20
00:01:21.313 --> 00:01:24.273
Are you free on Saturday?

21
00:01:24.673 --> 00:01:28.449
Yes. What shall we do?

22
00:01:28.849 --> 00:01:31.425
Shall we go to the cinema?

23
00:01:31.825 --> 00:01:35.409
Good idea! When?

24
00:01:35.809 --> 00:01:39.225
Shall we meet at eight in front of the cinema?

25
00:01:39.625 --> 00:01:43.425
Great. See you Saturday!

26
00:01:45.133 --> 00:01:54.909
Now you! Invite a friend: Are you free? Shall we go…? When shall we meet?

27
00:02:06.600 --> 00:02:10.736
Great! Now you can:

28
00:02:11.136 --> 00:02:16.544
You make suggestions, accept or decline – and explain why.

29
00:02:16.944 --> 00:02:19.064
See you soon!
